 talent, and, if successful, all creatures currently following you will lose track of your position.\n\t\tYou estimate your current chance to hide as %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"即使在你的敌人面前，你也学会了如何隐身。不管你与敌人有多近，你都可以尝试潜行，但敌人越少，距离越远成功率越高。\n\t\t你的成功率取决于你潜行强度的%0.2f倍（当前值 %d），以及所有视线能及你的敌人的侦测潜行能力（离你距离每有一格则下降10%%）。\n\t\t如果没有生物能看到你，你一定会潜行成功。\n\t\t这一技能会重置潜行技能的冷却时间。如果使用成功的话，所有敌人都会失去对你位置的感知。\n\t\t你估计你目前使用这一技能的成功率为%0.1f%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4e0974e1f47626ef755f1caac5a47f2cb03fd03a0dcd2a860443952318d809d9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8aee885ec994d3a0d5733920f8fb84cf6075fe41cfebe11f502374879cf7df4e","logical_entry_identity":"685bcc46ddc91792ccb45da85c24c0aa905e9d86cbd938fdaa6ccf27f306c0c0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Call upon nature to regenerate your body for %d life every turn and increase healing mod by %d%% for 8 turns.\n\t\tThe life healed will increase with your Willpower or Constitution (whichever is higher).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤自然的力量，每回合恢复 %d 生命值，治疗系数增加 %d%%，持续 8 回合。\n\t\t生命恢复量受意志值或体质值中较高一项加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f25e0f7966c345a8a7672bc80f74cbb3093fc7d67282452116697445f2a95988","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8aeeaa49a3bf07c1137fe9599278e91d96f09ae498b3ee7270cfc6dbad72991b","logical_entry_identity":"1c69332b37eebce9861d657594f7115219b5298fa6a01a6c26904af7c2e90d7a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"No time to talk fellow Wayist! ATTACK! FOR THE WAY!","source_tag":"_t","target":"没时间说话了，维网信徒同胞！进攻！为了维网！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f9f38352915f8ef32a6d308e40af1cca7794bb3036887042c565063193ad70e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8aef1dee8aba8aadb4e907bedb823e61c18e6f945d27089df61c98bbc9a86d76","logical_entry_identity":"81d037a64def8100b30765f5d8ceddb0c8c5d82bb72ed77e280a9e9765591225","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A formation of red crystal. It emits bright red, scorching light.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个由红色水晶构成的生物，它散发着耀